flowchart TB
  F["failed disk: OSD.7 down"] --> W{"has the data recovered?<br/>ceph -s"}
  W -->|"no"| WAIT["wait for active+clean<br/>or prioritise recovery"]
  WAIT --> W
  W -->|"yes"| SAFE["ceph osd safe-to-destroy 7"]
  SAFE --> RM["ceph orch osd rm 7 --replace --zap"]
  RM --> HW["physically replace the disk"]
  HW --> AUTO["the OSD spec sees the new disk<br/>and creates OSD.7 with the same id"]
  AUTO --> BF["backfill to the new OSD"]
